{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38631","headline":"梦仙谣 · 李沇","name":"梦仙谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海宫蹙浪收残月，挈壶掌事传更歇。\n银蟾半坠恨流咽，六鳌披月撼蓬阙。\n九炁真翁骑白犀，临池静听雌蛟啼。\n桂花浥露曙香冷，八窗玉朗惊晨鸡。\n裁纱翦罗贴丹凤，腻霞远闭瑶山梦。\n露乾欲醉芙蕖塘，回首驱云朝正阳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李沇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38631.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38631","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}